  "identifier": "agentclinic",
  "name": "AgentClinic",
  "description": "Multimodal medical agent benchmark that simulates end-to-end clinical workflows. Presents AI agents with patient-facing dialogue, EHR records, lab results, and medical images, requiring differential diagnosis and treatment planning across multiple specialties. Evaluates both physician-agent and patient-agent roles. Published in npj Digital Medicine 2026.",
