  "mach:judgement": "Assess",
  "mach:judgementReason": "Distinctive multimodal clinical benchmark combining EHR data, lab results, and medical imaging within realistic doctor-patient dialogue scenarios. Published in npj Digital Medicine 2026 (Nature portfolio). MIT licence, 304 GitHub stars. Notably models both physician and patient agent roles — a design choice that enables richer evaluation of clinical reasoning. Assess pending peer replication studies and broader adoption in the clinical NLP community.",
